  abilityId: 1850928
  abilityName: Seelie Illusion
  abilityDesc: 17 combo Light attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    9 combo Light attack on single foe (or probable 5% damage of foes' max HP), boosts
    Light elemental damage for 3 turns, probable 3 turns critical and elemental vulnerability
    infliction, activates Stealth and boosts own Atk and critical rate for 3 turns
    & fills OD gauge
